WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,980
I'll wait

2
00:00:03,260 --> 00:00:09,230
It seems that your friend is visiting me and the transfer has arrived.

3
00:00:09,230 --> 00:00:10,510
I'll prepare it for you first

4
00:00:10,990 --> 00:00:12,430
Such a simple girl

5
00:00:12,830 --> 00:00:14,110
When she came back, she asked her name

6
00:00:14,350 --> 00:00:15,990
I'll find another chance to repay today's favor.

7
00:00:15,990 --> 00:00:17,430
It’s been over half an hour by car

8
00:00:17,710 --> 00:00:23,900
Why haven't you come back to pick me up yet?

9
00:00:24,060 --> 00:00:25,060
How did you get hurt like this?

10
00:00:25,180 --> 00:00:26,420
We haven't seen you yet

11
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:28,020
I thought you reached the finish line first

12
00:00:28,140 --> 00:00:29,420
As a result, there is no one for you at the end.

13
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:30,860
I even turned off the phone when I was on the phone.

14
00:00:31,060 --> 00:00:32,780
Saw a wild cat halfway up the mountain

15
00:00:33,340 --> 00:00:34,260
Don't want to crush it

16
00:00:34,540 --> 00:00:36,140
He lost control and rushed under the road.

17
00:00:37,410 --> 00:00:38,690
The phone is probably broken

18
00:00:39,410 --> 00:00:40,770
A girl on foot saved me

19
00:00:40,970 --> 00:00:43,170
Send me here, Yanyu

20
00:00:43,410 --> 00:00:47,410
Just ask me to add the one on WeChat. Does it look good? Are you injured?

21
00:00:47,650 --> 00:00:49,370
I'll bandage it for you again. Don't touch me.

22
00:00:49,370 --> 00:00:50,810
You are a clean and kind girl

23
00:00:51,210 --> 00:00:52,330
This girl can do it

24
00:00:52,810 --> 00:00:55,290
How can she get a grown man like you down from the mountain?

25
00:00:55,410 --> 00:00:57,740
We have to thank her properly for messing with her.

26
00:00:58,580 --> 00:01:00,180
I don’t know if it’s something I can’t do.

27
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:03,360
You shouldn't have come back.

28
00:01:04,680 --> 00:01:06,320
I turned the stone bowl over to her half an hour ago

29
00:01:06,680 --> 00:01:08,160
There are still people these days who won’t do anything useless.

30
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:13,060
You can't tell if you're going to take the money and run away, right?

31
00:01:13,340 --> 00:01:15,140
Stone bowls are not a small price for civilians.

32
00:01:15,300 --> 00:01:16,220
How come you live in such a place?

33
00:01:16,620 --> 00:01:19,660
I'll give you a VIP ward, okay?

34
00:01:19,940 --> 00:01:21,840
If the ward is suddenly changed

35
00:01:22,440 --> 00:01:25,240
If she can't find anyone when she comes back, I'll go to the foot and lung to ask.

36
00:01:25,480 --> 00:01:32,050
If she encounters any trouble, she can help her. I'll ask her.

37
00:01:32,370 --> 00:01:33,690
Your medical bills have been paid

38
00:01:34,130 --> 00:01:35,170
People have left beforehand

39
00:01:35,290 --> 00:01:36,290
He even sent me a WeChat message

40
00:01:36,490 --> 00:01:37,410
I didn't see it myself

41
00:01:37,770 --> 00:01:43,640
He didn't even show off anything to say hello.

42
00:01:43,800 --> 00:01:45,000
Why are you still a little reluctant?

43
00:01:45,120 --> 00:01:46,120
Don't talk about this transfer

44
00:01:46,400 --> 00:01:48,160
Just think of it as her hard-earned money, don't mention it

45
00:01:48,240 --> 00:01:49,360
This girl is really interesting

46
00:01:49,760 --> 00:01:51,800
She saved your life, but she didn't take advantage of it.

47
00:01:51,880 --> 00:01:52,880
Get some benefit from you

48
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:54,320
When have we seen such a person?

49
00:01:54,520 --> 00:01:55,800
It makes me want to see her a little bit

50
00:01:55,920 --> 00:02:00,160
What does she look like? Which school is she from or has she graduated? What is her name?
